{"title": "Dune", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ambox\" style=\"--ambox-color: yellow;\"><div class=\"ambox-icon metadata\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/Warning-yellow.svg?81ba8c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"41\" data-file-width=\"378\" data-file-height=\"326\" /></div><div class=\"ambox-content\"><p class=\"ambox-title\">Under Construction</p><p class=\"ambox-text\">This page is under constructon! It's <b>not</b> supposed to be linked anywhere. You can help finishing this page if you trully want to.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">426 Dune</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\">Icon</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dune_(Icon).png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dune (Icon).png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Dune_%28Icon%29.png/250px-Dune_%28Icon%29.png?88ebc0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/Dune_%28Icon%29.png?88ebc0 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-LevelInformation\">Level Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Price\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Price\">Price</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Price druid-data-nonempty\">\n&#9646;550</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-HazardLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-HazardLevel\">Hazard Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-HazardLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\nB</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SupportedWeather(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SupportedWeather(s)\">Supported Weather(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SupportedWeather(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nRainy, Stormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Minefield</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Technical\">Technical</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.4</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nFacility: 0.002%<br />Mansion: 0.46%<br />Mineshaft: 0.002%<br /><b>Art Gallery:45.88%</b><br />Atlantean Citadel: 0.02%<br />Carnival: 0.002%<br />Deep Sewers: 7.65%<br />Greenhouse: 0.06%<br />Rubber Rooms: 0.06%<br /><b>Spooky Manor: 45.88%</b></div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n25</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n33</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 6</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nMasked, Bunker Spider, Spore Lizard, Backwater Gunkfish</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nEarth Leviathan, Eyeless Dog</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n8</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n10</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n12</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Exterior_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exterior Ambience</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Major_Story_Spoilers:_Falling_Debris\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Major Story Spoilers: Falling Debris</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Dune</b> is a large moon mainly consistent of expansive stretches of desert with a few oceans in between. It used to be a popular place for lavish mansions and buildings for those who could afford such luxuries. However due to frequent incidents with Earth leviathans, cacti infestations and large sandstorms, most of these locations have been left abandoned.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Abandoned.<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Hot, dry terrain, large deserts.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> A simple ecosystem, dominated by earth leviathans.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<p><b>Dune</b> is largely a dry and somewhat hilly desert. Most of its flora is cacti and bushes, and a small oasis can be found to the right and south of the ship. There is a ravine in front of and to the left of the ship with two bridges to cross over it to a large building, which is the main entrance.\n</p><p><b>Dune</b> has three smaller concrete buildings around the exterior as well, which are the fire exits. The first is to the right and east after crossing the upper bridge, the second is to the right and south of the ship near a fence and the oasis, and the third is almost directly behind and to the west of the ship.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exterior_Ambience\">Exterior Ambience</span></h3>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"17\" data-mwtitle=\"Etern_outside_loop.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Etern_outside_loop.wav?be8563\" type=\"audio/wav\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Etern_outside_loop.wav/Etern_outside_loop.wav.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Etern_outside_loop.wav/Etern_outside_loop.wav.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p><b>Dune</b> supports Rainy, Stormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, or Minefield weather by default. A waterfall can be seen to the left of the lower bridge during Rainy or Stormy weather.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Major_Story_Spoilers:_Falling_Debris\">Major Story Spoilers: Falling Debris</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>If players decided to overload and blow up <a href=\"/wiki/ResearcherxB\" title=\"ResearcherxB\"><b>ResearcherxB</b></a>, debris from the ship can fall onto <b>Dune's</b> exterior in front of the ship on a hill. If players land on <b>Dune</b> in the future on that save file, a mild outbreak of white mold will be present on the exterior and two <a href=\"/wiki/Infected_Bunker_Spider\" title=\"Infected Bunker Spider\"><b>Infected Bunker Spiders</b></a> will spawn on the exterior at the start of the day.</span></span>\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DuneCrash.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The debris and white mold outbreak.\"><img alt=\"The debris and white mold outbreak.\" src=\"/images/thumb/DuneCrash.jpg/500px-DuneCrash.jpg?a8595c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/DuneCrash.jpg/750px-DuneCrash.jpg?a8595c 1.5x, /images/thumb/DuneCrash.jpg/1000px-DuneCrash.jpg?a8595c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Crafting a <b>Blank floppy disc</b> on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\"><b>Galetry</b></a>, inserting it into the <b>Floppy disc machine</b> on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Etern\" title=\"Etern\"><b>Etern</b></a>, and logging the <b>Dune floppy disc</b>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/ResearcherxB\" title=\"ResearcherxB\"><big><b>ResearcherxB:</b></big></a> <b>Dune</b> can be one of the random moons that requires placing a <b>Triangulation device</b> on its exterior.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Book</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Book.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Book.png/60px-Book.png?36cf6c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Book.png/90px-Book.png?36cf6c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Book.png/120px-Book.png?36cf6c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td